@page "/"

@* Note: No need for rendermode here, it applies per-component. *@

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Hello, world!</h1>

<p>Welcome to your new app.</p>

Notice that individual pages/components can be placed inline here and they work the same.

<p>
    For this inline component, we are giving the IncrementAmount parameter a value of 10.
    This means that even though the button says Add 1, it will actuall add 10.
</p>
<Counter IncrementAmount="10"></Counter>